    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: MDQ products (SBQQ__SubscriptionType__c = Renewable AND segmentation enabled) lacking required subscription setup fields.
Why it matters: The MDQ engine can&apos;t segment-price the product — quotes either error or fall back to non-MDQ pricing, missing the multi-year ramp pricing the deal needs.
Suppress a finding: for placeholder MDQ products pending full setup.
Disable the detector: only when MDQ isn&apos;t used. Most enterprise CPQ orgs should leave this on.</value></values>
